i><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover new paths</strong>, side areas, and secrets each time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die, learn, and push further.</strong><br>Every death opens a new branch of the story\u2014and every Crossing is yours alone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782960/extras/f84c96381256017121cf44a89fcb7908.avif?t=1748011251\" width=616 height=82 /></span><i>Sap drips from the trees like blood. The roots twitch like veins. The forest does not sleep. It waits.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It remembers what you were.<br>It watches what you become.<br>And somewhere in its hollow chest, something is still beating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not the end. This is between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782960/extras/f859ca4be22e2ae69a4f01eb9147f6ef.avif?t=1748011251\" data-has-big width=800 height=272 /></span></p>",
