        "notes": "Crossings includes depictions of fantasy violence in a dark, norse myth-inspired world. Players engage in first-person melee combat against creatures like trolls, draugr, and other supernatural enemies, with depictions of wounds, intense impacts and enemy deaths.\r\n\r\nThe game explores mature emotional themes such as death, grief, fate, and vengeance, told through environmental storytelling and abstract narrative sequences. There are no depictions of sexual content, drug use, or self-harm. However, the atmosphere is intentionally eerie and may be unsettling for some players."
